  "id": "mina-and-lucys-guide-to-slaying-dracula",
  "title": "Mina and Lucy's Guide to Slaying Dracula",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "When a mysterious ship washes ashore in Whitby, best friends Mina and Lucy begin to wonder if there’s something strange about the new kid in school. With Dr. Van Helsing as their guide, Mina and Lucy will come face to face with a terrifying threat…from the legendary Dracula himself… Starring Bradley Whitford as Grandpa Van Helsing, Suri Marrero as Mina, Genna DuQuesnay as Lucy, Ritchie Coster as Dracula, Marissa Jaret Winokur as Wren Fields, Anthony Atamanuik as Principal Quincey, Toks Olagundoye as Mrs. Dracula, MaryLynn Suchan as Sue Ward, Che Tafari as Jonathan, Julian Chowdhury as Vlad, Jeffery Benson as Art, Sabrina Glow as The Thomas Triplets. For more great shows and to listen early and ad-free, visit ⁠GZMShows.com⁠ .",
